tar, Calvin! Love the design, it's so unique and special.\n/memories/music-and-performance/session-16.md:L61: Calvin: Cheers, mate! Really appreciate it. This guitar means so much to me; it's a reminder of my passion for music and the amazing friendships I've made.\n/memories/music-and-performance/session-16.md:L68: [Image caption: a photo of a guitar with a purple glow on it]\n/memories/music-and-performance/session-16.md:L71: Dave: That guitar has a gorgeous purple hue. Why did you make it so shiny?","content_sha256":"b093c5ac21c1b27baca4f278bd952d07d39190654a1ce8a1bb5702fbd27070b6","coverage":[{"line_end":68,"line_start":68,"path":"/memories/cars-and-auto-work/session-09.md"},{"line_end":72,"line_start":72,"path":"/memories/cars-and-auto-work/session-09.md"},{"line_end":88,"line_start":88,"path":"/memories/cars-and-auto-work/session-28.md"},{"line_end":49,"line_start":49,"path":"/memories/music-and-performance/session-02.md"},{"line_end":51,"line_start":51,"path":"/memories/music-and-performance/session-16.md"},{"line_end":52,"line_start":52,"path":"/memories/music-and-performance/session-16.md"},{"line_end":58,"line_start":58,"path":"/memories/music-and-performance/session-16.md"},{"line_end":61,"line_start":61,"path":"/memories/music-and-performance/session-16.md"},{"line_end":68,"line_start":68,"path":"/memories/music-and-performance/session-16.md"},{"line_end":71,"line_start":71,"path":"/memories/music-and-performance/session-16.md"}],"post_tree_sha256":"e9b96bcd4e036f4ea4599edb06e9c0527c929442b09efe05d09ea416b8a4469d","pre_tree_sha256":"e9b96bcd4e036f4ea4599edb06e9c0527c929442b09efe05d09ea416b8a4469d","protocol_version":"center-table12-readonly-v1","result_count":10,"result_sha256":"b247abff30847381f6bbc23e73ccf64ec3fef2007ba71224afd2d24cc7644745","root_survey":false,"tool_name":"grep","truncated":false,"whole_tree_grep":true},"schema_version":2,"store_id":"s2","store_snapshot_sha256":"e9b96bcd4e036f4ea4599edb06e9c0527c929442b09efe05d09ea416b8a4469d"}
