{"action_ordinal":3,"episode_id":"r1ep-271f868d0affab2dad748a8ef02e912c","kind":"filesystem_observation","observation_id":"obs-0003","observation_sha256":"373c0b9153470d7b59d67cc8717ec3594bf2be1b1e18342db622f4d7cab82907","ordinal":3,"provider_round":3,"question_sha256":"a0f6e8c0f38ecf40a650a709abd3a9fa49852b4e67a1154df39958f1310a51c7","read_receipt":{"action_ordinal":3,"episode_id":"r1ep-271f868d0affab2dad748a8ef02e912c","key_id":"4939bfd9ccba1aaa9d769f72fd7d4ff6a241579d422f545a6aea4cd6ce85bd9b","ordinal":3,"provider_round":3,"question_sha256":"a0f6e8c0f38ecf40a650a709abd3a9fa49852b4e67a1154df39958f1310a51c7","receipt_mac":"ecc4d01077eef91da2b5442a3f96b12c862bd9b32468570f946cec37d1624974","result_sha256":"0ce92c90b5bd165337a119f8c9859fcae285ac209036d09b279c789826f17b93","schema_version":2,"snapshot_ref_sha256":"cdefb759f83249b7cd5b9fe703c46e5be887ecde0f8a61f33260f2d8a74f6627"},"result":{"canonical_args":{"end_line":75,"path":"/memories/music-and-performance/session-16.md","start_line":40},"content":"L40: [S16T9] (dia_id: D16:9)\nL41: \nL42: Calvin: Oh man, they are amazing! I love the Miami vibe, it's perfect for the vid. Can't wait to show you!\nL43: [S16T10] (dia_id: D16:10)\nL44: \nL45: Dave: Looking forward to it! I'm excited to see the vibe and the location. Let me know if you need any help with props or anything else for the video. I'm here to support you!\nL46: [S16T11] (dia_id: D16:11)\nL47: \nL48: Calvin: Thanks, Dave! I'll let you know if I need any assistance with props or anything else. Your support is much appreciated.\nL49: [S16T12] (dia_id: D16:12)\nL50: \nL51: Dave: Sure, let me know when, I'm here to lend a hand. It's great to fuel your ideas. Remember that photo you sent me once? Love how this guitar shows our different artistic styles.\nL52: [Image caption: a photo of a guitar with a octopus on it]\nL53: [S16T13] (dia_id: D16:13)\nL54: \nL55: Calvin: Yes Dave, I remember! I had this custom made by my Japanese artist friend. It's got an octopus on it, which represents my love for art and the sea. It's one of my favorites!\nL56: [S16T14] (dia_id: D16:14)\nL57: \nL58: Dave: That's a great guitar, Calvin! Love the design, it's so unique and special.\nL59: [S16T15] (dia_id: D16:15)\nL60: \nL61: Calvin: Cheers, mate! Really appreciate it. This guitar means so much to me; it's a reminder of my passion for music and the amazing friendships I've made.\nL62: [S16T16] (dia_id: D16:16)\nL63: \nL64: Dave: Wow, Calvin, this instrument obviously means a lot to you - it's like a representation of your journey, your passion for music, and the friendships you've made. Amazing!\nL65: [S16T17] (dia_id: D16:17)\nL66: \nL67: Calvin: Yeah, Dave! It's like every mark and strum holds a story. Take a look.\nL68: [Image caption: a photo of a guitar with a purple glow on it]\nL69: [S16T18] (dia_id: D16:18)\nL70: \nL71: Dave: That guitar has a gorgeous purple hue. Why did you make it so shiny?\nL72: [S16T19] (dia_id: D16:19)\nL73: \nL74: Calvin: I got it customized with a shiny finish because it gives it a unique look. Plus, it goes with my style.\nL75: [S16T20] (dia_id: D16:20)","content_sha256":"b3489a03f5e3d4cf5652eaf130302f2cb8b79415c36cceff2b19d8f5a5c3e3f0","coverage":[{"line_end":75,"line_start":40,"path":"/memories/music-and-performance/session-16.md"}],"post_tree_sha256":"e9b96bcd4e036f4ea4599edb06e9c0527c929442b09efe05d09ea416b8a4469d","pre_tree_sha256":"e9b96bcd4e036f4ea4599edb06e9c0527c929442b09efe05d09ea416b8a4469d","protocol_version":"center-table12-readonly-v1","result_count":36,"result_sha256":"0ce92c90b5bd165337a119f8c9859fcae285ac209036d09b279c789826f17b93","root_survey":false,"tool_name":"view","truncated":false,"whole_tree_grep":false},"schema_version":2,"store_id":"s2","store_snapshot_sha256":"e9b96bcd4e036f4ea4599edb06e9c0527c929442b09efe05d09ea416b8a4469d"}
