{"action_ordinal":19,"episode_id":"r1ep-271f868d0affab2dad748a8ef02e912c","kind":"filesystem_observation","observation_id":"obs-0004","observation_sha256":"8723345e685ed41c99be7938a41e2a167bcdecbb9bf12fa351aa3ccd7846faa7","ordinal":4,"provider_round":12,"question_sha256":"a0f6e8c0f38ecf40a650a709abd3a9fa49852b4e67a1154df39958f1310a51c7","read_receipt":{"action_ordinal":19,"episode_id":"r1ep-271f868d0affab2dad748a8ef02e912c","key_id":"4939bfd9ccba1aaa9d769f72fd7d4ff6a241579d422f545a6aea4cd6ce85bd9b","ordinal":4,"provider_round":12,"question_sha256":"a0f6e8c0f38ecf40a650a709abd3a9fa49852b4e67a1154df39958f1310a51c7","receipt_mac":"907ace353a61b867227d331d6ea1109540c29ccc4d66918efca16ea4be9bcd33","result_sha256":"b14d9da7f2ec8bf26c9c4174dd3b6fdd57e1dbc18201b150c1a3165eb917c158","schema_version":2,"snapshot_ref_sha256":"cdefb759f83249b7cd5b9fe703c46e5be887ecde0f8a61f33260f2d8a74f6627"},"result":{"canonical_args":{"end_line":100,"path":"/memories/cars-and-auto-work/session-28.md","start_line":80},"content":"L80: \nL81: Dave: I found it last week, and it was in bad shape, but I saw the potential. I spent ages restoring it.\nL82: [S28T20] (dia_id: D28:20)\nL83: \nL84: Calvin: Wow, Dave, that is an awesome job on restoring it! You've got some serious skills!\nL85: [S28T21] (dia_id: D28:21)\nL86: \nL87: Dave: Thanks Calvin! It took some work, but I'm happy with the result. Take a look at the logo we created for our rock band!\nL88: [Image caption: a photography of a guitar logo with the company band logo]\nL89: [S28T22] (dia_id: D28:22)\nL90: \nL91: Calvin: Cool logo, Dave! What's the story behind it?\nL92: [S28T23] (dia_id: D28:23)\nL93: \nL94: Dave: Cool! It's the logo for my rock band. I've been a fan for ages and have had the opportunity to join them.\nL95: [S28T24] (dia_id: D28:24)\nL96: \nL97: Calvin: Wow Dave! Music really has a way of touching our souls.\nL98: [S28T25] (dia_id: D28:25)\nL99: \nL100: Dave: Yeah, Calvin! It's amazing how music can really move us. It's almost like a language for our souls.","content_sha256":"a5f71285616bb17abce1a04679bf6c3c545d8bcb8c2c239f3cdd0dd23da94488","coverage":[{"line_end":100,"line_start":80,"path":"/memories/cars-and-auto-work/session-28.md"}],"post_tree_sha256":"e9b96bcd4e036f4ea4599edb06e9c0527c929442b09efe05d09ea416b8a4469d","pre_tree_sha256":"e9b96bcd4e036f4ea4599edb06e9c0527c929442b09efe05d09ea416b8a4469d","protocol_version":"center-table12-readonly-v1","result_count":21,"result_sha256":"b14d9da7f2ec8bf26c9c4174dd3b6fdd57e1dbc18201b150c1a3165eb917c158","root_survey":false,"tool_name":"view","truncated":false,"whole_tree_grep":false},"schema_version":2,"store_id":"s2","store_snapshot_sha256":"e9b96bcd4e036f4ea4599edb06e9c0527c929442b09efe05d09ea416b8a4469d"}
